# Kite Weather
#
# In tune, in time, and wrong anyway. Nothing is detuned: the unease is in
# the harmony. A low E never moves, and the chords above it pull against
# it — E minor, then F major over E, E minor, then B-flat major over E, the
# tritone. The hook is short, minor and circling, repeated until it sticks,
# leaning on F (a half step above home) and B-flat (the furthest note from
# it); the second time round it ends B-flat to B and creeps back in.
#
#   bars 1-4    pad and a music box over the pedal; a swell into the beat
#   bars 5-12   heavy half-time drums, the pedal, the hook twice
#   bars 13-15  the break: a heartbeat kick; the hook again, an octave down,
#               sung by a second voice alone; a metal clank on the off-beats
#   bar 16      nothing — only the room, and a reversed swell rising through it
#   bars 17-24  everything; the second voice follows the hook a bar behind,
#               in canon, an octave down
#   bars 25-28  the drums and the pedal leave; the hook breaks off; the last
#               chord is the tritone, and it is cut
#
# Drums are samples bounced from Patina's own 909 and broken on purpose by
# scripts/kite-weather-kit.py (run it first; it writes renders/kite-kit/).
# 4/4 at 76 bpm; bar n starts at beat 4*(n-1).

bpm 76
gate 0.95
tail 4

automate tape_wow
0.05
automate tape_flutter
0.02
automate tape_age
0.4
automate tape_drive
0.3
automate chorus_mode
2
automate chorus_rate
0.4
automate chorus_depth
0.1
automate chorus_hiss
0.4
automate spring
0.08
automate reverb_wet
0.32
automate reverb_decay
0.82
automate reverb_tone
2800
automate width
1.15
automate comp_in
1
automate comp_threshold
-24
automate comp_ratio
1
automate comp_attack
3
automate comp_release
4
automate comp_makeup
2
automate comp_mix
0.5
# germanium: an edge under the beat, more when everything plays
automate fuzz
0.12 R:64 0.26:2@smooth R:30 0.08:4@smooth

# --- pad: Kaini, two saws a few cents apart, a chord a bar
track pad vel=0.5 patch=kaini reverb_send=0.3
([E3 B3 E4 G4]:4 [F3 A3 C4 E4]:4 [E3 B3 E4 G4]:4 [F3 Bb3 D4]:4)x3
[E3 B3 E4 G4]:4 [F3 A3 C4 E4]:4 [E3 B3 E4 G4]:4
R:4
([E3 B3 E4 G4]:4 [F3 A3 C4 E4]:4 [E3 B3 E4 G4]:4 [F3 Bb3 D4]:4)x3
automate pad.attack
0.6
automate pad.osc2_level
0.6
automate pad.detune
7
# the pad is pulled out from under bar 16, and the last chord is cut
automate pad.release
2 R:59.9 0.08:0.1@step R:3.9 2:0.1@step R:47.9 0.08:0.1@step
automate pad.gain
0.25 0.55:16@smooth R:80 0.45:4@smooth
automate pad.cutoff
520 R:64 820:8@smooth R:24 520:12@smooth

# --- the pedal: Kaini, mono, a sub underneath; it never leaves E
track bass vel=0.6 patch=kaini gain=0.85
R:16 (E2:4)x11 R:4 (E2:4)x8 R:16
automate bass.mono
1
automate bass.sub
0.45
automate bass.attack
0.03
automate bass.release
0.5
automate bass.cutoff
380

# --- music box: Bocuma plucks, by hand
track pluck vel=0.3 len=0.5 patch=bocuma pan=-0.35 reverb_send=0.4
(E3@0.29~+0.006 R B3@0.24~-0.002 R G4@0.30~+0.001 R E4@0.24~+0.008 R F3@0.30~+0.015 R C4@0.23~+0.009 R A4@0.32~+0.012 R E4@0.23~+0.005 R E3@0.31~+0.015 R G4@0.24~-0.002 R B3@0.30~+0.012 R E4@0.21~+0.005 R F3@0.28~-0.010 R D4@0.23~-0.011 R Bb3@0.31~-0.002 R F4@0.23~-0.004 R)x3
E3@0.28~+0.016 R B3@0.27~+0.002 R G4@0.30~+0.012 R E4@0.24~-0.002 R F3@0.30~-0.019 R C4@0.25~+0.008 R A4@0.30~+0.011 R E4@0.24~-0.010 R E3@0.29~+0.011 R G4@0.23~-0.004 R B3@0.31~-0.004 R E4@0.20~-0.002 R
R:4
(E3@0.35~-0.003 B3@0.30~-0.002 E4@0.29~-0.001 G4@0.27~-0.014 B3@0.30~+0.003 E4@0.28~+0.001 G4@0.32~+0.003 B3@0.29~-0.012 F3@0.36~+0.009 C4@0.28~+0.006 E4@0.27~+0.008 A4@0.28~-0.002 C4@0.30~+0.011 E4@0.27~-0.007 A4@0.30~+0.009 C4@0.30~-0.002 E3@0.35~+0.016 G3@0.29~-0.007 B3@0.31~-0.006 E4@0.28~-0.001 G4@0.28~+0.003 E4@0.32~+0.007 B3@0.28~-0.020 G3@0.32~-0.003 F3@0.34~+0.011 Bb3@0.31~+0.000 D4@0.31~+0.000 F4@0.30~-0.010 Bb3@0.31~+0.002 D4@0.31~+0.009 F4@0.30~-0.005 D4@0.33~+0.001)x2
(E3@0.29~-0.001 R B3@0.27~-0.011 R G4@0.31~-0.020 R E4@0.24~+0.001 R F3@0.31~-0.004 R C4@0.22~-0.004 R A4@0.32~-0.001 R E4@0.22~+0.010 R E3@0.29~+0.010 R G4@0.23~-0.009 R B3@0.33~+0.012 R E4@0.20~+0.010 R F3@0.33~+0.002 R D4@0.24~-0.011 R Bb3@0.32~+0.002 R F4@0.20~+0.012 R)
automate pluck.vel_filter
1.4

# --- the hook: Kaini B, mono
track tune vel=0.55 patch=kaini-b gain=1.8 reverb_send=0.22
>16
E4:1 G4:0.5 F4:0.5 E4:1 B3:1 C4:1 A3:0.5 B3:0.5 C4:2 E4:1 G4:0.5 F4:0.5 E4:1 G4:1 F4:1 D4:0.5 E4:0.5 Bb3:2 E4:1 G4:0.5 F4:0.5 E4:1 B3:1 C4:1 A3:0.5 B3:0.5 C4:2 E4:1 G4:0.5 F4:0.5 E4:1 G4:1 F4:1 D4:0.5 Bb3:0.5 B3:2
R:16
E4:1 G4:0.5 F4:0.5 E4:1 B3:1 C4:1 A3:0.5 B3:0.5 C4:2 E4:1 G4:0.5 F4:0.5 E4:1 G4:1 F4:1 D4:0.5 E4:0.5 Bb3:2 E4:1 G4:0.5 F4:0.5 E4:1 B3:1 C4:1 A3:0.5 B3:0.5 C4:2 E4:1 G4:0.5 F4:0.5 E4:1 G4:1 F4:1 D4:0.5 Bb3:0.5 B3:2
E4:1 G4:0.5 F4:0.5 E4:1 B3:1 C4:1 A3:0.5 B3:0.5 C4:2 R:8
automate tune.glide
0.05

# --- the second voice: the hook an octave down — alone in the break, then a bar behind
track ghost vel=0.5 patch=kaini-b gain=1.2 pan=0.3 reverb_send=0.45
>48
E3:1 G3:0.5 F3:0.5 E3:1 B2:1 C3:1 A2:0.5 B2:0.5 C3:2 E3:1 G3:0.5 F3:0.5 E3:1 G3:1
R:8
E3:1 G3:0.5 F3:0.5 E3:1 B2:1 C3:1 A2:0.5 B2:0.5 C3:2 E3:1 G3:0.5 F3:0.5 E3:1 G3:1 F3:1 D3:0.5 E3:0.5 Bb2:2 E3:1 G3:0.5 F3:0.5 E3:1 B2:1 C3:1 A2:0.5 B2:0.5 C3:2 E3:1 G3:0.5 F3:0.5 E3:1 G3:1 F3:1 D3:0.5 Bb2:0.5 B2:2
automate ghost.glide
0.05
automate ghost.gain
1.3 R:63 0.85:1@smooth

# --- drums: sampled, broken, and wet; half-time and heavy
track kick sample=renders/kite-kit/kick.wav root=C3 fixed mode=oneshot gain=0.5 vel=0.9
>16
(C3:2.5 C3:1.5 C3:2.5 C3:1.5 C3:2.5 C3:1.5 C3:1.5 C3:1 C3:1.5)x2
(C3:4@0.55)x3
R:4
(C3:2.5 C3:1.5 C3:2.5 C3:1.5 C3:2.5 C3:1.5 C3:1.5 C3:1 C3:1.5)x2
C3:2.5 C3:1.5 C3:4@0.5
R:8
automate kick.reverb_send
0.1
track snare sample=renders/kite-kit/snare.wav root=C3 fixed mode=oneshot gain=0.55 vel=0.85
>16
(R:2 C3:2)x8
R:16
(R:2 C3:2)x8
R:2 C3:2
R:12
# dub throws at the ends of the big sections
automate snare.reverb_send
0.45 R:45.9 0.95:0.1@step R:2 0.45:0.1@step R:45.8 0.95:0.1@step R:2 0.45:0.1@step
track swell sample=renders/kite-kit/snare_verb.wav root=C3 fixed reverse mode=oneshot gain=0.7 vel=0.8 reverb_send=0.3
R:14.2267 C3:1.773@0.8 R:46.227 C3:1.773@0.9
track hats sample=renders/kite-kit/hat.wav root=C3 fixed mode=oneshot bits=8 rate=11025 gain=2 pan=0.25 len=0.5
>16
(C3@0.85 C3@0.4)x32
R:16
(C3@0.85 C3@0.4)x32
R:16
automate hats.reverb_send
0.12
track clank sample=renders/kite-kit/clank.wav root=C3 mode=oneshot gain=1.0 pan=0.45 reverb_send=0.6
R:49.5 G2:0.5@0.5 R:1.5 C3:0.5@0.5 R:1.5 C3:0.5@0.5 R:1.5 G2:0.5@0.5 R:1.5 C3:0.5@0.5 R:1.5 C3:0.5@0.5 R:9.5 G2:0.5@0.5 R:7.5 C3:0.5@0.5 R:7.5 C3:0.5@0.5 R:7.5 G2:0.5@0.5
